{"screen_name": "lol04null", "first_seen": "2025-09-26T16:57:17.895385+00:00", "last_updated": "2025-09-26T16:57:17.895385+00:00", "profile": {"id": 1027589, "acceptable": false, "creator": true, "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1455170609093419008/vaGI_HoF.jpg", "name": "通信", "nsfw_acceptable": true, "screen_name": "lol04null", "language": "ja", "body_size": 1000, "received_works_count": 156, "received_nsfw_works_count": 60, "appeal_receivable": false, "sent_first_works_count": 0, "sent_public_works_count": 0, "instruction": "unspecified", "description": "ご意見ご感想 https://wavebox.me/wave/bd2xk2n4zk18by5y/", "busy": false, "url": "https://wavebox.me/wave/bd2xk2n4zk18by5y/", "show_social_profile": true, "accept_expiration_days": 15, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "received_requests_average_response_time": 52784, "completing_average_time": 1142556, "nc": 176, "twitter_uid": "1363783817039777793", "user_service_link": [], "banned": false, "banned_by": "", "complete_rate": 0.95, "og_image_url": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Ffcdn.skeb.jp%2Fassets%2Fv1%2Fcommons%2Fogp.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=1200&h=630&s=fb919ed2f719addcbe44cbdea9c1851a", "skills": [{"genre": "art", "default_amount": 14000}, {"genre": "comic", "default_amount": 16000}], "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@lol04null/works/156", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 2717557, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ace318e/uploads/origins/aaa8fae4-2f5b-4cb3-aa04-f34ebaba4047?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=863af69c488907f50d5e77dbbb388e2a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ace318e/uploads/origins/aaa8fae4-2f5b-4cb3-aa04-f34ebaba4047?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f98f5e39d0d95d9d09dcca9c381645f8", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！以前から貴方の絵柄で拝見したいと思っていたTRPGの探索者がいるので、是非描いていただけたらと思います！\n\nCoC「唸れ！暁コメディーショー」にて登場する2人の男性漫才コンビを描いていただきたいです！\n\n<キャラ説明>\nHO1 ツッコミ「眼鏡田 目画男」(めがねだ めがお)\n年齢　24歳\n身長　175cm\n普段は大人しそうな顔をしているが、内面はそんなことはない。「でひゃひゃ！」とクセの強い笑い声を出す。何かをしようと思ったらすぐ動くタイプだが、周りのことをかなり巻き込みがち。\n自分とお笑いと相方が大好き。あとエゴサも好き。\n「冗談だってぇ、ほら、緊張ほぐしてやろうとしたんだよ！感謝しろよ〜」\n\nHO2 ボケ 「毒島」(ぶすじま)\n本名は凩　泰陽（こがらし　たいよう）\n年齢　30歳\n身長　158cm\n\n毒舌ボケを担当。先輩後輩同期関係なく毒舌を吐く。だが抜けているところがありうっかりミスしたり恥をかいたり、体を張ったりしているので結構愛されているキャラ。\nオフは丸メガネをつけていて毒が完全に抜けきっている。女性経験ではメンヘラムーブをかましすぎて「重い」という理由で3回別れている\nよく眼鏡田と共通の友達に眼鏡田の話をして俺のほうが眼鏡田のこと知ってるし！！！！ムーブをかます。\n「眼鏡田がそういうなら俺もついてくよ」\n「おまえが相方でよかったよ、ほんと」\n\n<使用用途>\n他SNSにて貴方の名前を記載した上で転載したり、プロフィールに使用させていただきます！\n\n構図の指定は特にありません！\n何卒、ご検討よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/122_SxfIQRVBz3aHb-HXcoM-8KkM6Zwsk", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/155", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb9f8bf9/uploads/origins/488c27a2-67b9-4a15-886f-47c888c6bac0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=37255211732a64226de571a242efdea3", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 2581009, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/154", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0da92a07/uploads/origins/217bda88-efd8-46e4-acd2-f8d639b24c15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e2f996f73a773c3c0769478ce07d0f7a", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/153", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55bad899/uploads/origins/97b9e569-8360-4276-b09e-97da59efddde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9595a4d9071432e8106e4a4b3e3e926c", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3343868, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/152", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 1533673, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75557491/uploads/origins/770f173a-806f-4917-97d1-7dc86a5587d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7e913f2bec1295771463b84a13c7c25", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75557491/uploads/origins/770f173a-806f-4917-97d1-7dc86a5587d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=234a10c987308e52d0cb20ae6620affe", "src_set": ""}, "body": "通信様はじめまして。\n通信様の描かれる隈に心を揺さぶられ、申し込みに至りました。\nCoCシナリオ【蹂躙するは我が手にて】の私と友人のキャラクターをお願いしたい次第です。\n友人には許可済、シナリオネタバレはありません。\n\n【1人目】\n・ツェザーリ・ヨルガスキー　26歳\n・身長180cm体重69kg\n軍人としてある程度筋肉はあるが、指揮系統にいるため薄く筋肉が乗る程度。脂肪がつかないためどちらかというと痩せ型で骨張っている。\n・顔つき等：太陽が当たらない国の育ちのため顔色が悪く隈が酷い。父親譲りの黒髪黒目の上、酷い隈と顔色の悪さから陰湿そうな印象だが顔立ちはそこまで悪く無い。\n参謀総長という立場から人を信用しておらず、笑顔でも目は笑っていない。策略家で常に二手三手先を考えているので、人を見定めるような視線を送ることがあり冷ややかな圧がある。\n\n【2人目】\n・ヴィクトル・スラートキフスノフ 29歳\n・体格：195㎝前後の長身。\n体格はがっしりとしていて、軍人らしい筋肉のついた身体（STR15、SIZ17）\n・顔つき：彫りが深く、ロシアなど北方系の色素の薄い綺麗な顔ですが、顔半分や身体が戦争の傷跡によりケロイド状の為欠けていたり、かなり皮膚が引き攣っているため、人が見ると恐ろしいと思われる。傷がなければかなり綺麗な顔をしている。\n表情自体は基本柔和、戦いの時だけ瞳孔が開くタイプ。\n\n外見詳細は、ドライブの画像を参照ください。\n\n軍服は各自国軍服（資料①②）、か（資料③④）の描きやすい方でお願いできれば幸いです。\n（どちらも協力関係です）\n下記に各国の詳細（wiki）を参考までに掲載しています。\n\n①\nhttps://battle-glazer-940.notion.site/2daf7a7f952947b2afabd8e98efbfdb9\n\n②\nhttps://acute-apricot-d17.notion.site/baf3dca8defc4187bf461fde157a3864\n\n・関係性等\n元々敵国同士、実力を認めている故の脅威であり、長らく犬猿の仲だったが、終戦後に距離を縮め互いに好意がある現状です（資料⑥⑦参照）\n\nシチュエーション等はお任せ致しますが、通信様の描かれる一枚目の暗めの雰囲気と表情が大変好みなため、戦争を経験した2人の狂気が見えると嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OQKtoJ8GBWDZimVRaDmQYUAIYkuIG7BG", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/151", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3002391, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c670505/uploads/origins/91f44e8e-35ba-4dec-ae48-647b8402f403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0522dc0ad7f4dc617f8db662c3c4cc0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c670505/uploads/origins/91f44e8e-35ba-4dec-ae48-647b8402f403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71e99dae4ccabfe2ca7aefb865531835", "src_set": ""}, "body": "通信さんこんにちは､再送信申し訳ございませんが、先ほどのファイルに誤りがございましたので、修正いたしました。お目通しいただけますと幸いです。\nTwitterで通信さんの作品を拝見して、素敵な絵柄にとても惹かれました⋯！もしご縁がありましたら、私のオリジナルキャラクターをご依頼させて頂きたいです。\n\n▶︎キャラクター情報\nA\n・女／17歳／158cm\n・ツッコミ役、サッパリした性格ですが、ちょっと悪戯好き。\n\nB\n・男／17歳／185cm\n・ボケ役､いつも機嫌が良い､格好つける大好き､残念系男子｡\n\nモチーフは「悪党」です､距離感近めだと嬉しいのですが、それ以外の構図などは完全にお任せします！キャラクターの写真は以下に失礼します。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13wI0ZZ2XkOVYRvHk7G-7LLbUFybB-SAT\n\n▶︎使用用途\n・SNSアイコンなどへの使用\n・他の依頼時クレジット明記の上参考資料として使用\n\nここまで読んでいただき誠にありがとうございました。よろしければ何卒ご検討いただけますととても嬉しいです！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/150", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/86d9ed12/uploads/origins/40128de0-8052-4adb-8511-65ead0390a81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ec35901aa0ecada2f06b2fc1317cb265", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3031033, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/149", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a3f086e/uploads/origins/df722247-1dfc-4f5e-a9bc-b7c82db392a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=92053f1ad3d5d19234fe972e2d11a7d1", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/148", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 311071, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0193ad2/uploads/origins/b2e00b78-58de-4f02-9472-43014af6d7ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19c2dff579cae6ba70158a8b67a75092", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0193ad2/uploads/origins/b2e00b78-58de-4f02-9472-43014af6d7ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c01d9680387f4ef2fe0447af763f3a0c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, 通信様! I really like the clean lines and vivid expressions in your works! Would it be all right if I invited you to paint my original characters?\n\nThey are partners and treat each other like brothers.\n\n【1】\n32-year-old, 163cm tall. Only 16 years old in appearance. He used to be a assassin. Always smiling, looks very tender, but is actually lack of emotion. ドS. Interested in playing tricks on his partner.\n\n【2】\n29-year-old knight, 187cm tall. Positive and confident. Seems careless but tender and sensitive to emotion in fact. Deliberately acting childish sometimes.\n\nI want to see character 1 hug character 2 from behind, and talk to character 2 like a gentle demon.\n\nFeel free to choose one of the clothes shown in the URL. Where no designated, please feel free to draw.\nThank you for reading! If you can accept my request, it will be my honor.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HzMTfllfqL_41nrTFXa-ufWbbp_ckwhF?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/147", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/259b94ab/uploads/origins/bf7c40d8-293c-4a05-a771-795be4d87742?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f9e6d9328f658a303df46e78378e4124", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3031033, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/146", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb3e1ddb/uploads/origins/e40bfd12-60ff-4685-ba99-363a26155945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b0cbe604cb12fe1815384325d35b8b5f", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3213458, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/145", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6bfbbcb/uploads/origins/4b5b6b95-0f23-4259-a148-6d1929efc3cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=61a891317d501f891cb8797b27c2e285", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 3343868, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/144", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 2518139, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6986e0bb/uploads/origins/5d25b2ea-d502-4613-a767-4ea47594c2b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecd526996c5e9ee0caa5247c87a6a46b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6986e0bb/uploads/origins/5d25b2ea-d502-4613-a767-4ea47594c2b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b05d19fc995ed0538dda46c59a648692", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! Your art is very striking and pretty and I was hoping you could draw my characters, Fubuki and Riyou!\n\nFubuki is a boyish looking samurai woman with short, blue hair. She has yellow eyes and a scar on the right cheek. She's a very serious person who tries her best at everything she does. She's a kind person but she has trouble expressing herself. \n\nRiyou is a pretty kunoichi woman with long, red hair. She has green eyes and usually has a dangerous smile on her face. She's very cheerful and charismatic on the surface, but keeps her dangerous and manipulative tendencies hidden.\n\nI'd like for the scenario to be Fubuki and Riyou's first kiss. Riyou flirts with Fubuki, who responds honestly and confesses her love for Riyou. After a moment, Riyou kisses Fubuki and confesses her own feelings quietly against Fubuki's lips. \n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PtU2r87L5Scs3oKVbuP-_FOlZXxXvyv1?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/143", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 2717557, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f185334d/uploads/origins/03e66907-b0a2-44bc-b035-5b1ea6871d94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d23614d7aadd528f7cec4d2441c25eb2", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f185334d/uploads/origins/03e66907-b0a2-44bc-b035-5b1ea6871d94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7e185d73f684d57cbbff3db0226990bb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello!\nI love the creative men you draw, with your skill of mixing vividness well with charm and disquiet, and with your wonderful smiling face.\nI would like to make a request for you to draw a character of my creation. They are good friends and best friends, and there is no romantic feelings between them. The materials are listed below.\nI will use the illustration on my social networking profile with your name on it, as wallpaper on my device, etc. I will use it for personal use!\nYou may wear either school uniform or regular clothes. The composition and size of the image will be left entirely up to you!\nAbout the relationship between the two of you\nThey are two high school boys who do mischievous things to each other, but have a deep friendship and a close sense of distance. Their relationship is what is commonly referred to as a bromance. Yohshou always smiles and has a cheerful personality, while Reiji is a little hard-featured and has a darker personality.\n\nI am sorry for your busy schedule, but please do not strain your body, and I would appreciate your consideration 🙇.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gyhTLzBTEYeSIOdqqji4EqqVsYy8M8dC", "nc": 24, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/142", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c52f20a2/uploads/origins/e82258cf-7304-4358-bd6e-962a502e36a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33d40d512719861788d799958ac84417", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "