92d505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e5d3eef1f1d65dc450266c31047a7777", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 849490, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/132", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 2548259, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a8e7ca4/uploads/origins/dd6f2696-8150-411d-b14c-02be4ae27bb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4d49ebff33b0716d332fb7a04b188c5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a8e7ca4/uploads/origins/dd6f2696-8150-411d-b14c-02be4ae27bb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9bb2244699ce3f8a543e1b5e7d7a0b9b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! We really, really love Tsushin-sama's creations!  I would like to request a black-and-white comic of our own creative coupling, Tadashi and Kimiyuki in their school days (I have my partner's permission & he is also a fan of Tsushin-sama). ⬇️ Characters' settings ■Tadashi: A negative, sneaky, nerdy guy. He has a fetish for black hair. He hates \"yo-kas\" (cheerful people). He hates Kimiyuki the most among them. He is very nosy and bothers me. Too close! He scares me! Impossible! I thought he must be making fun of me...but then Kimiyuki started dating his twin sister and it was the worst. That's why yo-kas are like this! On the other hand, I really liked Kimiyuki when he had black hair and I used him as a wanker.  Kimiyuki is a cheerful and popular gal in the army. She sometimes has black hair and sometimes blonde hair. She's beautiful. She wants to get along with Mishima-kun (Tadashi). But he hates her and she is depressed. ...... She has no other choice but to satisfy her lust for Mishima by making a move on Tadashi's twin sister. He was found out and dumped, and Mishima hated him even more.  The setting of ⬆️ is from the school days, and now Tadashi to Kimiyuki is a twisted obsession similar to faith, while Kimiyuki to Tadashi is a way of life and protection. The coupling is Tadashi x Kimiyuki, with Kimiyuki > Tadashi in height. They had a physical relationship once when they were students, but Tadashi (the aggressor) forced his way into it. Kimiyuki's hair color can be either black or blonde. If he has black hair, it will be the same as it is now, even when he was a student. I will leave the situation up to you. Thank you very much in advance! https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-KZkxBO51gm8FGZGT54gL9gzLXFhTp39", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@lol04null/works/131", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1027589, "client_id": 1847164, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/47d556b2/uploads/origins/b65a415c-ef42-4beb-9133-26f9f04803bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b9b3bdedd8b2150127a1edfc4907884", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/47d556b2/uploads/origins/b65a415c-ef42-4beb-9133-26f9f04803bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef73b0d1606818919e895975a9cc6ec3", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Thank you for reopening the Skeeb...!\nI really love your works. I am really happy to be able to see your works, because your pictures, world view, and characters are something only you can create. Thank you so much.\n\nThis time, I would really like to ask you to draw a character of my own creation. I have had my character drawn several times before, and I really love it, so I would like to make a request to have it drawn again.\n\nI would like to ask you to draw my character again.\nAppearance\n Late 20's male\nBlonde hair (a little long), hazel eyes (concentric circles), only the right eye is blind and whitish in color.\nLeft arm missing from above the elbow.\nShe wears earrings in both ears and a blue natural stone bracelet on her right wrist.\nBackground.\nHe has a sense of dread and self-loathing because his girlfriend was killed by a monster decades ago because of him.\nHe is fighting everyday to avenge her death and succeeded in defeating the monster in his late 20's. However, his fellow fighters died in the battle, and he feels regret for having gotten them involved, for having failed to protect them, and for being the only one who survived.\nHe lost his right eye and left arm in battle.\nOthers\nAfter his revenge, he has been living a depraved life and has been thinking about when he will die, but he has not had the courage to do so.\nHe is dependent on cigarettes, alcohol, and antidepressants.\n(There is a sentence in the document, but you don't need to read it because it is the same as the one above. 🙇‍♂️)\n\nRequested content.\nI love the disturbing atmosphere and facial expressions of the character depicted by Mr. Tsushin, so I would like you to freely depict his helpless feelings, anxiety, dread, and self-loathing...!\nWounds, eye patches and bandages are fine! We leave it up to you.\nAbout the illustration, please use black and white this time...!\n\n[Intended use\nPersonal viewing\nUse of icons for X, etc. (with the ID of the person you are communicating with)\n\nPlease excuse the length of this message.\nWe are very sorry for your busy schedule, but we wou